      "en": "You shall sacrifice peace offerings, and shall eat there. You shall rejoice before the LORD your God.",
      "ko": "또 화목제를 드리고 거기서 먹으며 네 하나님 여호와 앞에서 즐거워하라",
      "source_text_hash": "53cc438efe072283b239f90b1ef9c04d928252bb6d38468bfe43853c534434c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "34d4e5368acac3dcd4f9b1812c3ff8caf33b2fa0f933fb5ea60b9be9f9bac7f2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
